        "content": "<p>alexcrichton opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14740\">PR #14740</a> from <code>alexcrichton:fix-panic-in-remaining</code> to <code>bytecodealliance:main</code>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Previously, we would panic on zero length reads or writes where the address was<br>\nout of range.  Now we just use the beginning of linear memory since the address<br>\ndoesn't matter.</p>\n<p>Part of <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/security/advisories/GHSA-93g3-36p8-x2gc\">https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/security/advisories/GHSA-93g3-36p8-x2gc</a></p>\n</blockquote>",
